                        "entry_id": "bd5cdd6e-d05d-3e60-8684-cbaf9d08b788",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Activité visant à prouver que les personnalités seraient secrètement transgenres ^([1])."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Conspirationnisme"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0dff6552-20dc-4868-9384-bcff9551ce3f",
                                "sense_id": "f527a6bf-3885-3e75-8f47-bfc771db264e",
                                "text": "Le mot « transvestigation » désigne l'activité consistant à tenter de déceler, dans les images de personnalités, des éléments de nature à prouver que ces célébrités sont en réalité du sexe opposé à celui qu'elles prétendent."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c2e056de-014d-4083-9f4e-f389600a2041",
                                "sense_id": "f527a6bf-3885-3e75-8f47-bfc771db264e",
                                "text": "Brigitte Macron n’est pas la première personnalité publique à être la cible de transvestigation."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3519fb68-a034-4254-80bf-9e29d2ae45cb",
                        "source_entry_id": "bd5cdd6e-d05d-3e60-8684-cbaf9d08b788",
                        "source_sense_id": "f527a6bf-3885-3e75-8f47-bfc771db264e",
                        "target_lang_word": "transvestigation",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "transvestigation",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "65679498-9eb9-3293-9a2a-d2caac56836f",
                                        "entry_id": "ac387865-1bbc-3247-973b-bcd6e9ecb284",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An informal investigation into whether a public figure is secretly transgender, generally conducted by analyzing that person's appearance and anatomical structure."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Internet"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0416fa9e-5753-46c3-9fc9-cb23a02fbeb1",
                                                "sense_id": "65679498-9eb9-3293-9a2a-d2caac56836f",
                                                "text": "The conspiracies I think are really bad is the ones that come from elitism and say that one group is better than another, so that's what I think is really stupid. Another thing that gets me are transvestigations, conspiracies about people's gender, like Justin Bieber being a girl and Miley Cyrus being a guy. It's just so stupid."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92da03df-ec4f-45b1-9da5-7f0727ae6a6b",
                                                "sense_id": "65679498-9eb9-3293-9a2a-d2caac56836f",
                                                "text": "It didn't take long for users to point out that EmergentReality has no idea about the various shapes, sizes, and anatomical variations that both trans and cis women experience. \"The Great Transvestigation strikes again, folks,\" Twitter user @indigowhiskey wrote. \"It's been over 3 hours and I still don't know what an Adonis belt is.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03b1f2c0-c16b-4548-a867-d5b339ad628c",
                                                "sense_id": "65679498-9eb9-3293-9a2a-d2caac56836f",
                                                "text": "[…] and \"transvestigations\" refers to attempts to expose celebrities (such as Madonna and Mike Tyson) as secretly transgender."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "840be5b5-c876-44cb-a555-87bc07322d6e",
                                                "sense_id": "65679498-9eb9-3293-9a2a-d2caac56836f",
                                                "text": "Inanna Snow, the \"Transvestigation Disclosure\" admin who argued that Cavill is trans due to his feminine gaze, was dethroned from her own page in recent weeks when others accused her of being trans, on equally flimsy grounds."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d6a36886-9722-4031-8b42-532bdd1e1ce1",
                                                "sense_id": "65679498-9eb9-3293-9a2a-d2caac56836f",
                                                "text": "The biggest transvestigation groups have a few thousand members – tiny by Facebook standards – and the biggest elite gender inversion Twitter account, Son of Man, has 25,000 followers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b071cf84-0532-4c62-80b3-af241243249c",
                                                "sense_id": "65679498-9eb9-3293-9a2a-d2caac56836f",
                                                "text": "The \"transvestigation\" conspiracy involves internet pundits using phrenology to \"prove\" that apparently cisgender celebrities are in fact trans, despite pretending otherwise"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
